      "statement": "BasePrepareRunMiddleware checkpoints idempotent setup by a SHA256 fingerprint of middleware name, latest message fingerprint, and config; once checkpointed in run_prepared_for, a resumed attempt with the same fingerprint skips preparation. ashape_model_call prepends rendered_system_prompt to model calls using call.prepending.",
