    {
      "id": "claim_ce52717833c346b6a64a18fcdec5149a",
      "statement": "SubdirAgentsReadMiddleware appends ancestor AGENTS.md files to read_file results after successful reads. It generates shallowest-to-deepest candidate paths relative to the read file's directory, loads via the run backend, truncates to 1,000 lines and 64 KiB, tracks loaded paths per thread, and produces a system-reminder stating deeper scope wins. Individual candidate failures do not break the requested read.",
      "evidence": [
