    {
      "id": "claim_282e5b4fad564013a5bb705707b832ea",
      "statement": "Reviewer fetches root convention document from GitHub Contents at the PR base SHA, preferring AGENTS.md and falling back to CLAUDE.md only on 404; non-200 responses, network failures, and oversized content (>64 KiB) yield no root context. Scoped ancestor instructions are fetched concurrently via git ls-tree and git cat-file from the trusted revision in shallow-to-deep order, with up to 8 concurrent operations; individual extraction failures do not block the review.",
